  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Mahendo 16",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo wasafiri hadi midzi ya Dabe na Lisitira ambako wakutana na mfuasi mmwenga yeihwa Timothi. Nineye kala ni Myahudi na wamkuluphira Jesu, ela ise kala ni Myunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afuasi osi a Jesu okala Lisitira na Ikonio kala achimlika Timothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo kala analonda kumhala aphiye naye. Ichibidi amutiye tsatsani kpwa sababu Ayahudi ariokala seemu hizo kala anamanya ise ni Myunani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ayunani taatiywa tsatsani, kpwa hivyo Ayahudi kala taaweza kumkubali Timothi hadi adekpwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azunguluka mudzi hadi mudzi, kuambira atu omkuluphira Jesu malagizo gotsapizwa ni mitume na vilongozi anjina hiko Jerusalemu, ili agalunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, kuluphiro ra makundi ga afuasi razidi kukula na atu achienjerezeka chila siku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo na ayae atsapa na seemu za Firigia na Galatia, kpwa sababu Roho Mtakatifu waazuwiya kusemurira neno ra Mlungu jimbo ra Asia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika mphaka wa Misia alonda kuinjira jimbo ra Bithinia, ela Roho wa Jesu achiazuwiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho aenderera na charo, achitsapa na seemu ya Misia hadi bandari ya Tirowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usikuwe Paulo waona mutu ruwiyani kula jimbo ra Makedonia akamuimira pho phephi, achimuamba, “Nakuvoya wedze Makedonia wedze uhuterye!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo ariphoona ruwiya hiyo, hwafunganya upesi kuphiya Makedonia, mana hwamanya Mlungu anahuiha hukatangaze habari nono kuhusu Jesu hiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwapanda meli bandari ya Tirowa huchiphiya mwenga kpwa mwenga hadi chisuwa cha Samotirake, na siku ya phiriye huchifika bandari ya Neapoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula hipho huaphiya Filipi ambako hwakala kpwa muda. Filipi kala ni mudzi muhimu wa jimbo ra Makedonia, nao kala unatawalwa ni Arumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya Kuoya iriphofika, hwatuluka kondze ya ryango ra mudzi hadi muhoni, ambako hwaona kala kuna phatu ambapho Ayahudi nkuvoya Mlungu. Huchisagala na huchibisha na achetu ambao kala anakutana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmwenga yekala anaphundza mafundzo gehu ni mchetu yeihwa Lidia kula mudzi wa Thiatira, ambaye kala ana bishara ya vitambara vya zambarau. Lidia kala anamuogopha Mlungu, naye wamngʼaza matso na achikubali mafundzo ga Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabatizwa phamwenga na atu osi a phakpwe kaya. Alafu achihualika kpwakpwe, achiamba, “Ichikala mukakubali kala ni mfuasi muaminifu wa Bwana Jesu, karibuni mkakale kpwangu.” Wahubembeleza, mwisho huchiphiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga huriphokala hunaphiya hipho phatu pha kuvoya Mlungu, hwakutana na mtumwa wa chichetu, yekala ana pepho. Pepho zomuhenda akale na uwezo wa kutabiri mambo ndigokpwedza badaye. Watajirisha sana matajirige kpwa kutabiriya atu bahati zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya msichana waandza kulunga-lunga Paulo na swiswi kuno anapiga kululu anaamba, “Atu hano ni atumishi a Mlungu Ariye Dzulu Zaidi. Nao anakutangazirani vira ambavyo munaweza kuokolwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waenderera kugomba hivyo siku nyinji, mwisho Paulo gamsinya, achimgalukira na achimuamba yuya pepho, “Kpwa dzina ra Jesu Masihi, tuluka himo mwa hiye msichana!” Na phapho hipho yuya pepho achituluka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enye a yuya mtumwa ariphomanya kala taaweza kuphaha pesa tsona, amgbwira Paulo na Sila achiaguruta hadi mbere za atu na akulu a Chirumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphoafisa hiko kpwa akulu, aashitaki achiamba, “Atu hinya ni Ayahudi, na anahenda fujo mwehu mudzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anafundza mila ambazo siyo sawa chishariya. Tahuzikubali na tahuweza kuzilunga mana hu anatsi a Utawala wa Rumi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umati wa atu waunga mkpwono mashitaka higo ga Paulo na Sila. Hara akulu a Chirumi alagiza avulwe nguwo na achapwe viboko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achapwa viboko sana kabisa, alafu achitiywa jela. Naye asikari wa jela walagizwa aarinde vinono sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asikari jela ariphophaha malagizo higo, waatiya chumba cha ndani na achiafunga silisili za maguluni phamwenga na mapande ga magogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriphofika saa sita za usiku, Paulo na Sila kala anavoya Mlungu na kumuimbira, mabusu ganjina kala ganaphundza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gafula dunia ichisumba sana hata misingi ya jela ichisumba. Phapho hipho miryango ya jela ichivuguka na silisili zokala zikafungbwa mabusu osi maguluni zichigbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya asikari jela walamuka na ariphoona miryango ya jela i wazi, watsomola upangawe achilonda kudziolaga, mana kala anaona mabusu gosi gakachimbira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Paulo achikota kululu achiamba, “Usidziolage! Hosi hu mumu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asikari walagiza taa, alafu achizola ndani kuno anakakama, achendagbwa maguluni pha Paulo na Sila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achimlavya Paulo na Sila kondze, chisha achiuza, “Mabwana, nihendedze mino hata niokoke?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimuamba, “Mkuluphire Bwana Jesu nawe undaokoka, uwe na atuo osi a phako kaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achimsemurira neno ra Mlungu na anjina osi a phakpwe kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho usiku, yuya asikari jela waahala achendaatsukutsa vironda. Chisha achibatizwa iye mwenye na atue osi a phakpwe kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahala Paulo na Sila achiphiya nao kpwakpwe kaya na achendaapha chakurya. Iye na atue osi ahererwa sana kpwa sababu amkuluphira Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligundzure kuriphocha, aamuli alavya asikari aphiye hiko jela akaambe, “Hara alume airi arichireni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi asikari jela wakpwendamuamba Paulo, “Akulu a Chirumi akalagiza mrichirwe, sambi, tulukani mphiye vyenu. Phiyani salama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Paulo achiamba, “Taiwezekana tse! Swino hu anatsi a Utawala wa Chirumi. Hwachapwa viboko mbere za atu, chisha huchitiywa jela bila ya kuphirikpwa kotini. Na vino analonda hurichirwe chisiri! Iyo taiwezekana! Naaedze ahulavye nyo enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hara asikari okala akahumwa, auya kpwendasema na hinyo akulu a Chirumi, nao ariphosikira kala Paulo na Sila ni anatsi a Utawala wa Rumi, amaka sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akpwedzaavoya msamaha na achiasindikiza kula jela na achiaambira atsame pho mudzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo na Sila ariphotuluka jela, aphiya nyumbani kpwa Lidia na achendakutana na afuasi anjina a Jesu, achiatiya moyo, chisha achiuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
